		["{npc:1965} guards the tunnel out of the valley, east of {area:77}; {npc:6782} stands beside him at its mouth."] = "{npc:1965}守卫着{area:77}东边离开山谷的隧道；{npc:6782}站在隧道口他的旁边。",
